<view class="workspace"><view class="workspace-head"><text class="head-title">成长与价值内容投稿</text><text class="head-sub">辅导员提交 · 管理员审核 · 学生端发布</text></view><view class="notice">内容应尊重事实和学生人格，不把观点差异简单等同于心理问题，不进入心理测评或风险预警。</view><view class="form-card"><text class="form-label">分类</text><view class="filter-row" style="padding:0;"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter-item {{category === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-category="{{item}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item}}</view></view><text class="form-label">标题</text><input class="form-input" value="{{title}}" maxlength="40" bindinput="onTitle" placeholder="请输入内容标题"/><text class="form-label">摘要</text><textarea class="form-textarea" style="min-height:110rpx;" value="{{summary}}" maxlength="120" bindinput="onSummary" placeholder="用一两句话说明内容价值"></textarea><text class="form-label">正文</text><textarea class="form-textarea" value="{{content}}" maxlength="3000" bindinput="onContent" placeholder="请输入正文"></textarea></view><view class="primary-btn" bindtap="submit">提交管理员审核</view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">我的投稿</text></view><view class="list-card" wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id"><view class="card-main"><text class="card-title">{{item.title}}</text><view class="card-meta"><text>{{item.category}}</text><text>{{item.status}}</text><text>{{item.reviewer}}</text></view></view></view></view></view>
